{
  "name": "bnn-custom",
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "private": true,
  "//": "⚠️ 禁止添加 \"type\": \"module\"。本包内含 UMD/CJS 依赖（lib/lunar/lunar.js 及 lib/song/vendor/mp3dec/*），一旦声明 type=module，这些 .js 会被当作 ESM，UMD 包装的 module.exports 分支失效 → 黄历/点歌解码静默降级（2026-11-20 实际踩过，6 个 mock 测试报红）。本包自有代码一律用 .mjs 扩展名，不需要 type 字段。",
  "description": "DSH QQ 机器人群聊玩法扩展 —— 积分经济 / 小店 / 点歌 / 语音合成 / 卡片交互 / 人格联动",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Bnnforce",
  "files": [
    "tools/",
    "commands/",
    "botplay/",
    "hooks/",
    "inbound/",
    "outbound/",
    "lib/",
    "scripts/",
    "docs/",
    "qqbot-pack.json",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "CONTRIBUTING.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "PORTING.md",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "PRIVACY.md",
    "THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "qqbot",
    "dsh",
    "extension",
    "extension-pack"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@zaofan/dsh-qqbot": ">=1.13.26"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "silk-wasm": "^3.7.1"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "doctor": "node scripts/doctor.mjs",
    "doctor:fix": "node scripts/doctor.mjs --fix",
    "sync:botplay": "node scripts/sync-botplay.mjs",
    "check": "node scripts/check-syntax.mjs",
    "report": "node ./lib/scripts/weekly-report.mjs"
  },
  "repository": {
